            <p className="text-sm text-gray-600">Choosing 'গণিত' in the filter select (data-testid subject-filter, optgroups 'শ্রেণি' and 'বিষয়') narrows the list to matching subjects and combines with the search term; bottom tab 'পড়াশোনা' (nav-learn) renders with aria-current=page</p>
